<p><em>Last updated: 30 July 2026</em></p>

<h2>1. Our promise</h2>
<p>We stand behind every product we make. If you're not satisfied with your aira experience, we're here to make it right.</p>

<h2>2. 30-night guarantee</h2>
<p>Try aira for 30 nights. If you're not happy with your purchase for any reason, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@shop-aira.com">contact@shop-aira.com</a> within 30 nights of delivery and we'll guide you through the return process.</p>

<h2>3. Magnetic strip returns</h2>
<p>The reusable magnetic strip is eligible for return within 30 nights of delivery, provided it is in good physical condition, not broken or damaged and returned in its original packaging.</p>
<p>To initiate a return, simply contact our support team with your order number. Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer.</p>
<p>If your order arrives damaged or faulty, that's on us: email us a photograph with your order number and we'll replace or refund it, with return shipping covered.</p>

<h2>4. Adhesive tabs returns</h2>
<p>Adhesive tab packs are eligible for return only if they are completely unopened and untouched. Once a pack has been opened or a tab has been removed, it cannot be returned or refunded.</p>
<p>We encourage you to try the tabs, they're designed to be used.</p>

<h2>5. Important notes</h2>
<p>Refunds are only available for purchases made directly through our official website. If you purchased through a third-party platform, please initiate your return through that platform directly.</p>
<p>Refunds will be processed within 5 to 10 business days of receiving your return.</p>

<h2>6. A note from us</h2>
<p>We're a small brand that genuinely cares about your experience. If something isn't working for you, reach out before you request a return, we'd love the chance to help first.</p>
